      "text": "BREAKING: Starlink helped rescue a Swedish sailor stranded off South Africa’s coast. 🇿🇦\n\nThe solo sailor’s 12-metre yacht developed mechanical problems 8 nautical miles off St Lucia, with strong winds forecast.\n\nHe used Starlink to contact the Ocean Sailing Association of South Africa, which alerted NSRI rescuers.\n\nTheir rescue boat towed his yacht through strong south-westerly winds to safety in Richards Bay, accompanied by two other yachts.\n\nStarlink connected him to help when he needed it most. ♥️",
